event: response.output_text.done
data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_0fdb43b6db871f01006ae54bdf513c87d097974366a6747c64","logprobs":[],"output_index":1,"sequence_number":214,"text":"Let the ball cost x dollars. Then the bat costs x + 1.00 dollars.  \nTheir total: x + (x + 1.00) = 1.10, so 2x + 1.00 = 1.10.  \nThus 2x = 0.10 and x = 0.05.\n\nFinal answer: The ball costs $0.05."}

